// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Doc_Delilah 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Doc Delilah 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1035024325" "Doc Delilah"
// ProfessionString :
"P1796928519" "Hero Historian"
// DescriptionString :
"P2977773839" "Doctor Delilah Stein was born with Herculean strength and incredible physical resistance.  She fought evil as a heroine for a time, but eventually found her real calling: history and archeology.  Now she combines her past life and her education into a new career as a chronicler of meta-human history, and an archeologist of the unusual.  Dr. Stein recently began investigating the lost hero bases in Overbrook, looking for clues to fill in the history of pre-Rikti War heroes and villains."
// HelloString :
"P3294080134" "Well, hello there!"
// HelloString :
"P2100778252" "Good to see you!"
// HelloString :
"P2908645248" "Howdy!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P155963480" "Well, how are you doing, {HeroName}?  I heard you were in the area and it is quite good to see you.  If you'll excuse me, I'm kinda busy right now, so why don't ya come back later?  If you're looking for people to help, maybe you should talk to that Jim Temblor fellow, or Miss Penelope Yin."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2455528330" "Well, hello there, {HeroName}!  Glad to see you made it out of that dust-up, too.  I told Penelope that I wanted to talk to you for a reason.  Now, little Miss Yin told me all about what you've done for her and her Daddy and I already knew that you were helping out Jim Temblor, that poor boy, so I know your heart's in the right place.  I'm also guessing that you just might have noticed that there's some awfully peculiar events going on around here.  I came to Faultline to investigate the meta-human history of the area, but I've begun to think that we've gotten some of that history terribly wrong..."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3027614611" "The truth about poor Mr. Temblor was sad, but we can't stay in a deep blue funk the rest of our lives, now can we?  Well now, if you'll excuse a lady, I reckon I have to write an award-winning paper or three out of all this, and set the record straight.  Keep safe, now, {HeroName}!"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1480163231" "Now just wait a second there, {HeroName}.  Just how many things do you have going on?  Finish some of it up and then come on back when you're ready."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2649145548" "I'm sorry, kiddo, but you'll need to be at least security level 20 before you can handle what I have for you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2049941960" "I know that you will prove more than capable.  I must say, I am impressed already with what you've done."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P582632961" "This is all getting downright crazy, but it's not over yet.  I am just greatly relieved that I have someone as dependable as you to help me."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3974611372" "I know a great deal about meta-human history, {HeroName}, and I know that someone with your power needs to concentrate on bigger troubles than what I have."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1498570757" "I know you met Doc Delilah already.  She is totally amazing.  She's smart, she's super-strong, and, well, she's enough to give a normal girl a complex.  But she's really nice, too.  She came out here because she wanted to explore the old hero bases and dig up, like, history and stuff.  Anyway, she said she wanted to talk to you about something important."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P109865790" "Meet Dr. Delilah Stein"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P280697725" "Cool.  I know that she thinks she found something big, but she's really gonna need help.  I can feel it."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2780191171" "I just talked to Agent G. <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>He says he'd like to see you.</A> He says it's about what we discovered, and about Arachnos."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1909709693" "Well, now this is peculiar.  You shouldn't ever have a reason to see this text."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


