// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Jim_Temblor 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Jim Temblor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1145393565" "Jim Temblor"
// ProfessionString :
"P860605582" "Angry Young Man"
// DescriptionString :
"P4064874952" "Jim Temblor lost his father when the villain Faultline destroyed the neighborhood of Overbrook, turning it into the ruin that still bears his name. Now that the City is trying to rebuild Faultline, Jim has returned to his old neighborhood looking for some closure, and maybe something else."
// HelloString :
"P403346502" "What do you want, 'Hero'?"
// HelloString :
"P2787317035" "Whatever."
// HelloString :
"P3454885144" "You got a problem?"
// HelloString :
"P2577297546" "Whatever"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P799691282" "Huh. You shouldn't ever see this text. Weird."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3540817738" "Who are you supposed to be?  Some kind of hero?  Did one of those do-gooders send you?  Well, I don't need your help!  I got it all covered!  Me and... <br><br>Me and... <br><br>Wait. Please, stop!  {HeroName}, don't go!  I'm sorry, I... I'm sorry. <br><br>I really do need help.  It's just that, I mean... <br><br>Look, I had a friend of mine who was trying to help me, but I think she's in trouble.  Real trouble..."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1758951959" "Thanks, {HeroName}.  It's better to know.  I guess."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3391477695" "Look, I know the whole city needs your help, but this is important stuff.  I need you to concentrate on this.  So, go finish your other stuff.  Fusionette, she's tough.  She'll be okay for a while. <br><br>Please, be okay 'Nettie."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1084546889" "Wait, you're not even Security Level 15?  Fusionette's a 15, and she couldn't handle it!  Look, I appreciate the help, but I can't send you to your death!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2616047261" "Thanks for helping.  I know I can be kinda hard to get along with, but, ah, thanks."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1577174517" "You've done a lot to help me.  Fusionette was my only friend for a long time.  I'm glad that isn't true anymore.  Thanks."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2475096952" "Look, I know you've got a lot to do, so don't worry about me.  I can handle it on my own now.  There are some other people out there who could use your help."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3825025170" "Jim Temblor lost his father when the villain Faultline destroyed the neighborhood of Overbrook, turning it into the wasteland that still bears Faultline's name.  Now that the city's started to rebuild, Jim's returned to find some answers, but word is he's found a lot of trouble with the Lost instead."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P4028679396" "Meet Jim Temblor"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2741664119" "Jim can be a bit tough to get to know, but deep down he's a good kid."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2339807421" "Hey, before you go, I know about <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>somebody else who could use really use some help.</A>"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1595966984" "Hey, <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>I heard that there were some people looking for you.</A> They wanted to talk to you about some stuff."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


