// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Penelope_Yin 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Penelope Yin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3268873349" "Penelope Yin"
// ProfessionString :
"P2693685804" "Trouble-prone Teenager"
// DescriptionString :
"P203288289" "The daughter of Wu Yin, owner of Yin's Market, Penelope Yin is a normal girl with a penchant for having strange things occur around her.  Many of the heroes who had their bases in Overbrook prior to its destruction had tales of strange things happening shortly after 'Perilous Penelope' swooped by on her scooter to drop off a delivery from her father's store.  Now that the city has begun reconstruction in Faultline, Penelope returned with her father to help re-open Yin's Market.  Shortly after their arrival, the local Clockwork began to protect Penelope from danger.  No one knows why the Clockwork keep their silent vigil over her safety, and the Clockwork King has issued no announcements on the subject."
// HelloString :
"P937337807" "Bet you've been busy!"
// HelloString :
"P3032117488" "Hiya!"
// HelloString :
"P41289459" "Welcome to Yin's Market!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P852578833" "I'm sorry, {HeroName}.  Yin's Market is closed, but it'll be open again when my dad gets back.  He'll be back.  Any day now."
// FirstVisitString :
"P845343898" "You're {HeroName}, right?  Oh, man, did Jimmy Temblor send you?  He and Ann, err, 'Fusionette' have been treating me like a little sister since before... <br>Everything... <br>Um, actually, I kinda could use some help.  Well, not me, I mean.  It's just that my Dad, he's been kidnapped!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P604033343" "Hey there, {HeroName}!  Yin's Market is open for business!"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2296826836" "Wait a second, {HeroName}.  Wow.  You're really busy, aren't you?  And a lot of it's really important stuff, too.  My Dad will be okay for a little while and lots of people need your help.  Finish up a few things and hurry back, okay?"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1618023126" "The guys who have my dad are really tough!  Are you Security Level 15?  You're not?  Well, thanks for offering to help, but I don't know if there's much you can do to until then."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3494139565" "You're the best!  I know you'll find my dad!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3365488834" "You're the coolest!  Hey, do you need a side-kick?  No, forget it.  My Dad would totally flip out."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3372573849" "Don't you worry about things.  I've got some people coming to help me and my Dad soon.  So, you go on and do some of the important stuff you need to do, okay?"
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P571696860" "There's this kid I know named Penelope.  Her dad used to run Yin's Market, back before, and she'd always latch onto Annette and me.  She was a little brat, but really nice.  Well, when her Dad found out the city was rebuilding, he came back to reopen his store, but I hear that he's gone missing.  Penelope's all by herself, well, aside from those weird Clockwork.  You helped me out so I was wondering if maybe you could help her out?"
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3507446349" "Meet Penelope Yin"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3213021361" "Thanks, {HeroName}!  Penelope's a sweet kid and her dad was always cool.  Oh, and just don't be surprised if she knows I sent you.  She's like that.  It's like she's psychic or something."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P858427668" "Hey, do you remember Doc Delilah?  Duh, everyone remembers her.  Anyway, <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>she wanted to talk to you about something.</A>"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P896893247" "Weird.  You shouldn't be able to see this.  Hey, are you going through the .pigg files?"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

